# Secrets for local `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in.
# For production: printf '%s' "YourSolanaPubkey" | npx wrangler secret put X402_PAY_TO

# Your public Solana wallet address (base58) — where USDC lands.
# Never a private key. Any wallet that can hold Solana USDC (Phantom, Solflare, etc.).
X402_PAY_TO=YourSolanaPubkeyHere
